/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Every issue with evidence, affected URLs, business impact and a recommended fix.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">2</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Prioritised backlog</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Ticket-ready items your developers can pick up, ordered by impact and effort.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">3</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Implementation</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">We ship the fixes ourselves where you prefer, then re-test each item.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">4</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">Verification</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/compon